                            "content": "Machine learning is a field of artificial intelligence that enables computers to learn from data and improve their performance without being explicitly programmed for every task. It uses algorithms to identify patterns and make decisions or predictions based on input information. This approach powers everything from personalized recommendations to advanced medical diagnostics.",
